  "intro": "Balancing a full-time job with university coursework or professional certification preparation requires a realistic, time-blocked revision strategy. Rather than attempting exhausting multi-hour study sessions after a long workday, working professionals succeed by allocating focused 45-to-60-minute study blocks during high-energy windows, leveraging active recall, and protecting weekend revision hours.",
