        id: 'system-test-vs-mock-exam',
        title: '2. System Test vs. Mock Exam vs. Official Exam',
        content: `
          <p>It is important to distinguish pre-test diagnostic tools from actual exams:</p>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>System Test / Equipment Check:</strong> A free diagnostic check verifying hardware, camera, and internet compatibility.</li>
            <li><strong>Practice Questions & Mock Exams:</strong> Self-study simulations designed to test your knowledge and build test stamina.</li>
            <li><strong>Official Exam:</strong> The formal graded test that determines course credit or professional certification.</li>
          </ul>
        `,
