        content: `
          <p>Software downloads and equipment checks are always free provided by testing vendors like Pearson VUE, Respondus, or Meazure Learning. However, official examination registration fees are set by certification boards (like PMI, CompTIA, AAPC, or NHA) or university tuition.</p>
        `,
